  "full_text": "Once upon a time, there was a boy named Tim. Tim loved to play outside with his friends. One day, while playing, they saw a big tree. The tree had a pretty, shiny silver arrow.\nTim and his friends wanted to play with the arrow. They looked at the arrow and laughed. \"Wow, that's a nice, Tim!\" said the arrow. Tim looked at the arrow and smiled. \"Yes, you're welcome,\" he said. \"Me too!\"\nTim and his friends played together. They caught the arrow and made a wish. They wished for a fun day in the park. The arrow said, \"Let's play with the arrow!\" Tim and his friends played with the arrow all day long.\nAfter playing, Tim and his friends had a fun day. They played with the arrow and the arrow all day. They were very happy. The arrow was not terrible anymore. Tim and his friends were happy that they had a new friend to play together.\n<|endoftext|>",
